# Verification required

Before claiming success (`done` / `READY` / `verified` / “fixed”): **IDENTIFY → RUN → READ** ([`change-control-manifest.mdc`](../change-control-manifest.mdc) § Verify gate · [debug/reference.md](../../ai-skills/debug/reference.md) § Close-out verification gate).

1. **IDENTIFY** — name the command or repro that proves the fix.
2. **RUN** — execute when a harness exists; else the smallest user-visible repro.
3. **READ** — quote pass/fail output (or explicit “no harness — user must confirm”).
4. Note what was **not** run · regression risks · callee grep if call targets changed ([`callee-redirect-cleanup`](../patching/callee-redirect-cleanup.mdc)).

Forbidden without fresh run/read: "should work", "looks correct", "done", unverified `READY`.
